Subject: [PATCH 6/9] fix(serialization): count only bytes written by
 SerializeIterator

GetNumberOfBytesWritten measured std::distance(begin, end) after appending,
so for a growable container that already held data it returned the total
size instead of the bytes written through this iterator (e.g. writing one
byte into a vector with two existing bytes reported 3).

